asic\nallowances for quarters (37 U.S.C. 403(a)) for members of the uniformed\nservices and the rate of monthly cadet or midshipman pay (37 U.S.C.\n203(c)(1)) are set forth on Schedule 8 attached hereto and made a part\nhereof.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"61 FR 237, PDF pages 1-10; Sec. 4","sha256":"370080ebbb5c2afd7f581227cd19cd76ae5f530264da28f94bd7d78b0d36b45f","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1996-01-03/pdf/95-31595.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:12984#sec4","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(a) Pursuant to sections 5304\nand 5304a of title 5, United States Code, locality-based comparability pay-\nments shall be paid in accordance with Schedule 9 attached hereto and\nmade a part hereof.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"61 FR 237, PDF pages 1-10; Sec. 5(a)","sha256":"370080ebbb5c2afd7f581227cd19cd76ae5f530264da28f94bd7d78b0d36b45f","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1996-01-03/pdf/95-31595.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:12984#sec5(a)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(b) The Director of the Office of Personnel Management shall take such\nactions as may be necessary to implement these payments and to publish\nappropriate notice of such payments in the Federal Register.\n=== PDF page 2 of 10 ===\n238 Federal Register / Vol. 61, No. 2 / Wednesday, January 3, 1996 / Presidential Documents\nSec. 6. Effective Dates. Schedule 8 is effective on January 1, 1996. The\nother schedules contained herein are effective on the first day of the first\napplicable pay period beginning on or after January 1, 1996.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"61 FR 237, PDF pages 1-10; Sec. 5(b)","sha256":"370080ebbb5c2afd7f581227cd19cd76ae5f530264da28f94bd7d78b0d36b45f","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1996-01-03/pdf/95-31595.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:12984#sec5(b)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null